---
description: SEO and performance for commercial landing pages
globs: app/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# SEO & Performance

- Full metadata: title, description, OpenGraph, Twitter cards from `siteConfig`.
- `lang="es"` on `<html>`; add JSON-LD `LocalBusiness` when real contact data exists.
- Hero LCP image: `priority` + correct `sizes`; gallery images lazy-loaded.
- Avoid client JS above the fold unless required (nav, carousel).
- Semantic HTML: one `<h1>` per page, section headings in order.
- Alt text on all event photos; describe the event, not "imagen 1".
